 Relat Res</source><year>2001</year><volume>383</volume><fpage>123</fpage><lpage>130</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00003086-200102000-00014</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Cohen MS, Bruno RJ (2001) The collateral ligaments of the elbow: anatomy and clinical correlation. Clin Orthop Relat Res 383:123&#x02013;130 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11210946</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pina</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Sabater</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Traumatic avulsion of the triceps brachii</article-title><source>J Orthop Trauma</source><year>2002</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>273</fpage><lpage>276</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00005131-200204000-00010</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Pina A, Garcia I, Sabater M (2002) Traumatic avulsion of the triceps brachii. J Orthop Trauma 16:273&#x02013;276 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11927810</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Madsen</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Surgical anatomy of the triceps brachii tendon: anatomical study and clinical correlation</article-title><source>Am J Sports Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>1839</fpage><lpage>1843</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1177/0363546506288752</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Madsen M et al (2006) Surgical anatomy of the triceps brachii tendon: anatomical study and clinical correlation. Am J Sports Med 34:1839&#x02013;1843 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16735585</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Windisch</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Tesch</surname><given-names>NP</given-names></name><name><surname>Grechenig</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Peicha</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The triceps brachii muscle and its insertion on the olecranon</article-title><source>Med Sci Monit</source><year>2006</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>290</fpage><lpage>294</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Windisch G, Tesch NP, Grechenig W, Peicha G (2006) The triceps brachii muscle and its insertion on the olecranon. Med Sci Monit 12:290&#x02013;294 </citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>